bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650610/extras/55b0c2a3259fea518948309bbe8158a0.avif?t=1717936045\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br>Play on 4 map types  with procedurally generated variations, 5 levels of difficulty and 4 computer opponents in single player mode.",
